The '''Greenhouse''' is a [[The Garden|Garden]] Plot unlocked at {{Coll|Garden Level 7}}. It is accessed after completing the {{NPCSprite|Carpenter}}'s offer as a [[The Garden#Visitors|Garden Visitor]] and obtaining the {{ID|Greenhouse Blueprint}}.

== Overview ==
While in the '''Greenhouse''', players can grow different crops and water them. They will grow while offline and can be harvested once mature, granting special '''Crop Effects'''. All crops have unique buffs, and some even have negative effects.

These buffs are as follows:

* {{Green|Harvest Boost}} - Increases {{Gold|Yield}} by {{Green|+20%}}
* {{Green|Improved Harvest Boost}} - Increases {{Gold|Yield}} by {{Green|+30%}}
* {{Green|XP Boost}} - Increases {{Dark Aqua|Farming XP}} of adjacent crops by {{Green|+20%}}
* {{Green|Improved XP Boost}} - Increases {{Dark Aqua|Farming XP}} of adjacent crops by {{Green|+30%}}
* {{Green|Water Retain}} - Retains watering status of adjacent crops by {{Green|+50%}}
* {{Green|Improved Water Retain}} - Retains watering status of adjacent crops by {{Green|+100%}}
* {{Green|Immunity}} - Provides {{Gold|Immunity}} to negative effects.
* {{Green|Effect Spread}} - Spreads other {{Green|buffs}} and {{Red|debuffs}} on the current crop to adjacent crops.
* {{Green|Bonus Drops}} - Harvested items additionally roll from an {{Pink|extra loot pool}}.
* {{Red|Harvest Loss}} - Decreases {{Gold|Yield}} by {{Red|-20%}}
* {{Red|XP Loss}} - Reduces {{Dark Aqua|Farming XP}} of adjacent crops by {{Red|-20%}}
* {{Red|Water Drain}} - Reduces watering status of nearby crops by {{Red|-30%}}

