== Mutations ==
{{Main|Mutations}}

[[Mutations]] have a chance to grow in the '''Greenhouse''' when specific crops are arranged in specific patterns. They can be analyzed in the [[Crop Analyzer]].

Upon harvesting a [[Mutation]], one has a chance to drop an {{ID|Ethereal Vine}}, which is used to unlock more crop slots in the '''Greenhouse'''. Once all crop slots are unlocked, they can also be used to unlock a 2nd and 3rd '''Greenhouse'''.

== Greenhouse Skins ==
{{Main|Greenhouse Skins}}

'''Greenhouse''' Skins are a type of cosmetic that changes the look of the Greenhouse. They can be applied to the '''Greenhouse''' at the [[The_Garden#The_Desk|Desk]].
